For a wish, I would probably suggest a standard greased blessed fixed
+2 Silver Dragon Scale Mail.  That will do for armor.  Until then, non-
metallic armor won't hinder your spellcasting, but you may still want
a piece or two anyway.  A second possibility for a wish is a blessed
fixed greased +2 staff of Aescelpius, which is a great weapon, but it
will blast you, you won't get to have an amazing AC, it may fail
(since 2 artifacts already exist), and it will replace you
magicbane...  So I guess you should just stick to dragon scale armor.
Later on, you may want a magic marker to write spellbooks and scrolls
with though.  Identify is nice.


